# Fundraising Admin Form Labels

When editing Partner Registry or other Fundraising admin forms:

- Do **not** rely on placeholder-only inputs for fields that usually have a default value (especially number/date fields such as Donation %, Parent display %, Effective from).
- Always show a **visible English label** above (or beside) the control so admins can tell fields apart after values are filled.
- Prefer partnership vocabulary in labels: Fundraising Cashback Grant %, family discount display %, Official Grant Account, Partner Community Code, Change reason.
- Placeholders may still hint at format; labels must remain readable when the input is non-empty.
